<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 17.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p>SINGAPORE CARGO 96/98 102/103 UNQ 192/195 SINGAPORE BUNKER 106/107 113/114 209/211 197/199</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker prices remained firm amid anticipated cargo demand from China while sellers were inactive waiting for higher prices, traders said. However, they said the upside could be limited near term as at least three cargoes were heading from the Middle East in the coming month.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3571)</p>
